### 生成图片：OpenAI（DALL·E）
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/image/draw
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenentId}}

{
  "modelId": 1,
  "prompt": "可爱的小喵星人",
  "width": 1024,
  "height": 1024,
  "quality": "hd"
}

### 生成图片：硅基流动（参考图、反向提示词、高级参数）
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/image/draw
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenentId}}

{
  "modelId": 2,
  "prompt": "中国长城，日落",
  "negativePrompt": "文字、水印",
  "referenceImageUrls": ["https://www.iocoder.cn/1.png"],
  "width": 1024,
  "height": 1024,
  "seed": 42,
  "steps": 30,
  "cfgScale": 7.5
}

### 生成图片：豆包 Seedream
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/image/draw
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenentId}}

{
  "modelId": 3,
  "prompt": "一只在雨后小巷的橘猫，电影感光线",
  "sizeLevel": "2K",
  "aspectRatio": "1:1"
}

### 生成专业绘画指令
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/image/optimize-prompt
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenentId}}

{
  "prompt": "一只猫在雨后的小巷"
}

### 获取【我的】绘图分页
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/image/my-page?pageNo=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenentId}}

### 获取公开的绘图分页
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/image/public-page?pageNo=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenentId}}

### 更新【我的】绘画的公开状态
PUT {{baseUrl}}/ai/image/update-public-my
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenentId}}

{
  "id": 1,
  "publicStatus": true
}

### 【Midjourney】文生图
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/image/midjourney/imagine
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenentId}}

{
  "modelId": 4,
  "mode": 20,
  "prompt": "中国旗袍",
  "version": "--v 7",
  "aspectRatio": "2:3",
  "stylize": 100
}

### 【Midjourney】融图
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/image/midjourney/blend
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenentId}}

{
  "modelId": 4,
  "imageUrls": ["https://www.iocoder.cn/1.png", "https://www.iocoder.cn/2.png"],
  "dimensions": "SQUARE"
}

### 【Midjourney】换脸
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/image/midjourney/swap-face
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenentId}}

{
  "modelId": 4,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.iocoder.cn/face.png",
  "targetUrl": "https://www.iocoder.cn/target.png"
}

### 【Midjourney】按钮动作
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/image/midjourney/action
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenentId}}

{
  "id": 1,
  "customId": "MJ::JOB::upsample::1::85a4b4c1-8835-46c5-a15c-aea34fad1862"
}

### 【Midjourney】局部重绘
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/image/midjourney/modal
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenentId}}

{
  "id": 1,
  "prompt": "换成一顶红色的帽子",
  "maskUrl": "https://www.iocoder.cn/mask.png"
}
